# MongoDB Atlas connection (database: nails)
# Replace <db_password> with your Atlas database-user password.
# Note: direct shard hosts are used instead of mongodb+srv:// because some home
# routers refuse Node's SRV DNS lookups (querySrv ECONNREFUSED).
